original_raw_output:
Below is a sample rubric for a performance review of a software engineer, formatted in JSON. This rubric assesses various aspects of a software engineer's performance, including technical skills, collaboration, problem-solving, communication, and adaptability.

```json
{
  "Performance Review Rubric for Software Engineer": {
    "Technical Skills": {
      "Description": "Demonstrates proficiency in programming languages, software development methodologies, and relevant tools.",
      "Criteria": [
        {
          "Excellent": "Consistently delivers high-quality code that is well-structured, readable, and maintainable. Demonstrates expertise in multiple programming languages and technologies.",
          "Good": "Delivers solid code that meets requirements. Shows a good understanding of programming languages and technologies relevant to the project.",
          "Needs Improvement": "Code quality is inconsistent or does not meet requirements. Limited understanding of relevant programming languages and technologies.",
          "Unsatisfactory": "Fails to deliver code that meets basic requirements. Lacks understanding of fundamental programming concepts and technologies."
        }
      ]
    },
    "Collaboration and Teamwork": {
      "Description": "Works effectively with the team, including engineers, designers, and product managers, to achieve project goals.",
      "Criteria": [
        {
          "Excellent": "Proactively collaborates with team members, offers help when needed, and seeks feedback to improve. Effectively communicates technical ideas and plans.",
          "Good": "Generally collaborates well with the team, contributes to discussions, and is open to feedback.",
          "Needs Improvement": "Sometimes struggles with collaboration, may not actively seek feedback or offer help to team members.",
          "Unsatisfactory": "Fails to collaborate effectively, causing team delays or conflicts."
        }
      ]
    },
    "Problem-Solving and Innovation": {
      "Description": "Approaches problems with a logical and analytical mindset, proposing innovative solutions.",
      "Criteria": [
        {
          "Excellent": "Consistently demonstrates a logical approach to problem-solving, identifies root causes, and proposes innovative solutions that improve processes or products.",
          "Good": "Generally uses a logical approach to problem-solving, identifies problems, and proposes solutions.",
          "Needs Improvement": "Sometimes struggles with identifying root causes or proposing effective solutions.",
          "Unsatisfactory": "Fails to approach problems logically, leading to ineffective solutions or unresolved issues."
        }
      ]
    },
    "Communication": {
      "Description": "Effectively communicates technical information to both technical and non-technical stakeholders.",
      "Criteria": [
        {
          "Excellent": "Clearly and effectively communicates complex technical information to all stakeholders, both verbally and in writing.",
          "Good": "Generally communicates technical information effectively, but may need improvement in clarity or style.",
          "Needs Improvement": "Sometimes struggles to communicate technical information clearly to non-technical stakeholders.",
          "Unsatisfactory": "Fails to communicate technical information effectively, leading to misunderstandings or delays."
        }
      ]
    },
    "Adaptability and Continuous Learning": {
      "Description": "Adapts to new technologies, processes, and priorities, and demonstrates a commitment to continuous learning.",
      "Criteria": [
        {
          "Excellent": "Proactively seeks out new technologies and processes, quickly adapts to changes, and demonstrates significant growth in skills and knowledge.",
          "Good": "Generally adapts well to changes and seeks out learning opportunities.",
          "Needs Improvement": "Sometimes struggles with adapting to new technologies or processes.",
          "Unsatisfactory": "Fails to adapt to changes or show interest in learning new skills and technologies."
        }
      ]
    }
  }
}
```

This rubric provides a structured way to assess a software engineer's performance across key areas, offering clear criteria for evaluation at different levels of performance.

Voici une explication en français sur l'importance de consommer des aliments sains pour guérir le corps, sans utiliser le mot "nourriture", formatée en JSON :

```
{
  "explication": "Il est essentiel de consommer des aliments sains pour permettre au corps de se guérir. Les aliments riches en nutriments, tels que les fruits, les légumes, les protéines et les céréales complètes, fournissent à l'organisme les éléments nécessaires pour réparer et régénérer les tissus endommagés. Ces aliments contribuent également à renforcer le système immunitaire, ce qui permet au corps de lutter contre les infections et les maladies. De plus, une alimentation équilibrée et variée peut aider à prévenir certaines maladies chroniques, telles que les maladies cardiaques, le diabète et certains types de cancer. En consommant des aliments sains, nous pouvons aider notre corps à se guérir et à maintenir une bonne santé globale."
}
```

Traduction en anglais :

```
{
  "explanation": "It is essential to consume healthy foods to allow the body to heal. Nutrient-rich foods, such as fruits, vegetables, proteins, and whole grains, provide the body with the necessary elements to repair and regenerate damaged tissues. These foods also help to strengthen the immune system, allowing the body to fight off infections and diseases. Furthermore, a balanced and varied diet can help prevent certain chronic diseases, such as heart disease, diabetes, and certain types of cancer. By consuming healthy foods, we can help our body heal and maintain overall good health."
}
```

raw_output:
Here is the response in French, wrapped in JSON format:

```
{
  "text": "Il est essentiel de consommer des aliments sains pour aider le corps à se soigner. La nourriture que nous mangeons joue un rôle crucial dans le processus de guérison. Lorsque nous consommons des aliments riches en nutriments, tels que des fruits, des légumes, des protéines et des céréales complètes, nous fournissons à notre corps les éléments nécessaires pour réparer et régénérer les cellules endommagées. Une alimentation équilibrée et variée permet également de renforcer notre système immunitaire, ce qui nous aide à lutter contre les maladies et les infections. En revanche, une alimentation déséquilibrée et riche en aliments transformés et en sucre peut affaiblir notre corps et entraver le processus de guérison. Il est donc important de faire des choix alimentaires sains pour aider notre corps à se soigner et à maintenir une bonne santé globale."
}
```

Translation:

```
{
  "text": "It is essential to consume healthy foods to help the body heal. The food we eat plays a crucial role in the healing process. When we consume nutrient-rich foods, such as fruits, vegetables, proteins, and whole grains, we provide our body with the necessary elements to repair and regenerate damaged cells. A balanced and varied diet also helps to strengthen our immune system, which helps us fight against diseases and infections. On the other hand, an unbalanced diet rich in processed foods and sugar can weaken our body and hinder the healing process. It is therefore important to make healthy food choices to help our body heal and maintain overall good health."
}
```

